# IshTopish mobile — copy to `.env`. Only EXPO_PUBLIC_* vars reach the app.

# Backend origin. Leave unset to use the tunnel/localhost fallback in src/lib/api.ts.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.0.10:8000

# Yandex Maps JavaScript API key — https://developer.tech.yandex.ru (free tier).
#
# OPTIONAL. Without it the app still shows real Yandex maps: it uses the static
# map endpoint (an image), which needs no key and no native module, and still
# supports pins, the 15 km ring, zoom and tap-to-pick. Setting a key upgrades
# those cards to a pannable JS-API map — which additionally requires a dev build
# that includes `react-native-webview` (run `npx expo run:android` after
# installing it; the old binary has no such native module).
#
# Allow the referer https://ishtopish.uz/ (the WebView's baseUrl) on the key, or
# leave the key unrestricted.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_YANDEX_MAPS_API_KEY=
